urname><given-names>R M</given-names></name><name><surname>Gazmararian</surname><given-names>J A</given-names></name><name><surname>Nurss</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development of a brief test to measure functional health literacy</article-title><source>Patient Educ Couns</source><year>1999</year><month>9</month><volume>38</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>33</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="medline">14528569</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pii">S0738-3991(98)00116-5</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0738-3991(98)00116-5</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14528569</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>Shoou-Yih D</given-names></name><name><surname>Bender</surname><given-names>Deborah E</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruiz</surname><given-names>Rafael E</given-names></name><name><surname>Cho</surname><given-names>Young Ik</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development of an easy-to-use Spanish Health Literacy test</article-title><source>Health Serv Res</source><year>2006</year><month>8</month><volume>41</volume><issue>4 Pt 1</issue><fpage>1392</fpage><lpage>412</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="medline">16899014</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pii">HESR532</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1475-6773.2006.00532.x</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16899014</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>T C</given-names></name><name><surname>Long</surname><given-names>S W</given-names></name><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>R H</given-names></name><name><surname>Mayeaux</surname><given-names>E J</given-names></name><name><surname>George</surname><given-names>R B</given-names></nam